snp-dists
------------------------------------------
Pairwise SNP distance matrix from a FASTA sequence alignment

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/tseemann/snp-dists

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/tseemann/snp-dists/archive/v1.2.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack snp-dists-1.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./snp-dists-1.2.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/snp-dists-1.2.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/snp-dists-1.2.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

